---
// Archive wing: 3D issue cover plus a numbered table of recent issues.
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="archive-wing" id="archive">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="part-header">
      <span class="ghost-numeral" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <div class="part-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow kicker">The archive</p>
        <h2 class="part-title">Start with any issue.</h2>
        <p class="part-body">
          Every back issue stays free and readable, no account required. Skim the glosses below and
          pick whatever matches the problem on your desk today.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="shelf">
      <div class="cover-scene">
        <div class="cover-shadow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="cover-book">
          <div class="cover-spine">
            <span class="spine-text">Daily Pill of AI</span>
            <span class="spine-mark">Rx</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cover-front">
            <img
              class="cover-image"
              src={`${base}images/wanderer.jpg`}
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <div class="cover-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <span class="cover-title">Daily Pill of AI</span>
            <div class="cover-tokens">
              <span class="token token-orange">daily</span>
              <span class="token token-purple">practitioner</span>
              <span class="token token-blue">receipts</span>
              <span class="token token-neutral">no hype</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="toc">
        <p class="toc-heading">Recent issues</p>
        <ol class="toc-list">
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">Small models, big receipts</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">what a 3B model can and cannot do for your pipeline</span>
          </li>
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">RAG is a data problem</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">why chunk size beats vector DB choice, with numbers</span>
          </li>
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">Agents that finish tasks</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">tool schemas, retries, and the boring path to reliability</span>
          </li>
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">Fine-tuning on a budget</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">when LoRA earns its keep and when prompting wins</span>
          </li>
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">Evals before demos</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">a 20-case harness that catches regressions early</span>
          </li>
          <li class="toc-row">
            <span class="toc-title">Context windows lie</span>
            <span class="toc-gloss">long context is not memory, and the benchmarks agree</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .archive-wing {
    padding-top: 130px;
  }
  .part-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .ghost-numeral {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: #ff950038;
    user-select: none;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 110px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }
  .part-copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .kicker {
    color: var(--orange);
  }
  .part-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .part-body {
    max-width: 560px;
    color: var(--ink-66);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .shelf {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 84px;
    margin-top: 64px;
  }
  .cover-scene {
    perspective: 1300px;
    justify-self: center;
    padding: 10px 0 30px;
  }
  .cover-book {
    width: 300px;
    height: 450px;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1);
    position: relative;
    transform: rotateY(30deg);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .cover-scene:hover .cover-book {
      transform: rotateY(10.5deg) translateY(-6px);
    }
  }
  .cover-shadow {
    filter: blur(10px);
    background: radial-gradient(at 40%, #0b173166, #0000 68%);
    height: 40px;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -22px;
    left: 12px;
    right: -8px;
    transform: rotateY(-30deg) translateZ(-40px);
  }
  .cover-spine {
    transform-origin: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0a142c, #0e1d3d 55%, #0b1731);
    border-top: 1px solid #ffffff14;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #0006;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    width: 46px;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 20px 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    transform: rotateY(-90deg);
  }
  .spine-text {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    color: #ffffffed;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .spine-mark {
    color: #ffffffd9;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cover-front {
    background: var(--navy);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border-radius: 1px 3px 3px 1px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 34px 28px 30px;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transform: translateZ(46px);
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 6px #00000059, inset -1px 0 #ffffff0f;
  }
  .cover-image {
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 30%;
    filter: grayscale() brightness(0.95) contrast(1.05);
    mix-blend-mode: luminosity;
    opacity: 0.8;
    pointer-events: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .cover-scrim {
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(#0b1731d9 0%, #0b173159 32%, #0b17314d 60%, #0b1731bf 100%);
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .cover-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    color: #ffffffed;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.18;
    position: relative;
  }
  .cover-tokens {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    max-width: 210px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .token {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    white-space: pre;
    background: #0b17318c;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 3.5px 7px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .token-orange {
    color: #ffd9b8;
    border: 1px solid #ffa35266;
  }
  .token-purple {
    color: #dcc6ff;
    border: 1px solid #bf8fff80;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .token-blue {
    color: #b9d4ff;
    border: 1px solid #73b0ff66;
  }
  .token-neutral {
    color: #ffffffd9;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff40;
  }
  .toc-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: var(--ink-55);
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .toc-list {
    counter-reset: issue;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .toc-row {
    counter-increment: issue;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline-soft);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 11px 0;
  }
  .toc-row::before {
    content: counter(issue, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--ink-40);
    flex: 0 0 26px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .toc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    color: var(--ink-86);
    flex: none;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .toc-gloss {
    min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: var(--ink-55);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cover-book {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
  @media (width <= 860px) {
    .shelf {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      justify-items: center;
      gap: 34px;
    }
    .cover-scene {
      padding-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .cover-book {
      width: 244px;
      height: 366px;
      transform: rotateY(24deg);
    }
    .cover-spine {
      width: 40px;
    }
    .cover-front {
      padding: 28px 22px 24px;
      transform: translateZ(40px);
    }
    .cover-title {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .toc {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
    }
  }
  @media (width <= 560px) {
    .ghost-numeral {
      display: none;
    }
    .toc-title {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
    .toc-row {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      row-gap: 2px;
    }
    .toc-gloss {
      flex: 1 0 100%;
      padding-left: 40px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
    }
  }
</style>
